<bold>Additional Table 2</bold>: List of evocated diagnosis (A) and care management (B) after management at the bedside in ward (supplement material).</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM3"><media xlink:href="13054_2021_3466_MOESM3_ESM.docx"><caption><p><bold>Additional file 3.</bold>
<bold>Additional Table 3</bold>: Summary of patients&#x02019; characteristics (supplement material).</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM4"><media xlink:href="13054_2021_3466_MOESM4_ESM.docx"><caption><p><bold>Additional file 4.</bold>
<bold>Additional Method</bold>: Details of propensity score (supplement material).</p></caption></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material content-type="local-data" id="MOESM5"><media xlink:href="13054_2021_3466_MOESM5_ESM.docx"><caption><p><bold>Additional file 5.</bold>
